#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:odoo_simplify_access_management.sam_profile_view_form
msgid "Remove \"Powered by Odoo\" from all Email Templates"
msgstr "一键移除所有邮件模板中的 \"Powered by Odoo\""

#. module: odoo_simplify_access_management
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:odoo_simplify_access_management.sam_profile_view_form
msgid "Remove the 'Powered by Odoo' block from the stored body of ALL email templates, in every installed language? Outgoing emails and previews are already cleaned automatically while White Label is enabled; this also cleans the body you see in the template editor. The operation is idempotent and can be re-run anytime."
msgstr "确定从所有邮件模板正文(含所有已安装语言)中移除存量的 'Powered by Odoo' 区块吗?白标启用期间,发出的邮件和预览已自动实时清理;本操作让模板编辑器中看到的正文也干净。操作幂等,可随时重复执行。"

#. module: odoo_simplify_access_management
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:odoo_simplify_access_management.sam_profile_view_form
msgid ""
"While White Label is enabled, outgoing emails and template previews are\n"
"                                        cleaned automatically on the fly (all languages). This button additionally\n"
"                                        removes the stored \"Powered by Odoo\" block from every email template body\n"
"                                        (Settings / Technical / Email Templates), so the template editor is clean\n"
"                                        too. Re-run it after installing or upgrading modules that reload templates."
msgstr ""
"白标启用期间,发出的邮件与模板预览已自动实时清理(所有语言)。\n"
"                                        本按钮额外把数据库中每个邮件模板正文里存量的 \"Powered by Odoo\" 区块\n"
"                                        (设置 / 技术 / 电子邮件模板)一并移除,让模板编辑器中看到的正文也干净。\n"
"                                        安装或升级模块重新加载模板后,可再次执行。"

